{
    "title": "Omniheroes",
    "description": "Log in now and get 3 free 999 draws! \u2014 A gift from the Valkyries!\r\n\r\nOmniheroes is a fantasy-themed idle strategy RPG. Dear Omniguardians, Palmarius awaits your salvation! Through the darkness, rescue the captive Valkyries from the demons and fight together against the evil threatening the world!\r\n\r\n > Assemble 100+ heroes\r\nRescue a host of captivating Valkyries and recruit them to your ranks. Each Valkyrie possesses unique skills and charm\u2014build your ultimate team! Log in now to enjoy hundreds of free draws and choose the legendary Valkyries you desire!\r\n\r\n > Engage deeply to reveal the many facets of your Valkyries\r\nValkyries reside in your Manor. Heal them and engage in delightful interactions to unlock various outfits! As a reward, the Valkyries will also help boost your power.\r\n\r\n > One-tap power surge\r\nEasily develop your Valkyries, upgrade and enhance them to unlock hidden powers in Palmarius. Enjoy rich rewards even while idle, making your progress effortless.\r\n\r\n > A visual and auditory feast with top-quality effects\r\nBehold 100+ enchanting and powerful heroes, designed and modeled by top-tier graphical artists, as they unleash spectacular skills in stylish 2D graphics.\r\n\r\n > Exciting seasonal updates\r\nEach season brings new and thrilling content for you to explore, ensuring a fresh and exciting gaming experience. Season 5 is here! Engage in epic battles between gods and mortals, join forces with human and divine heroes to defeat the deities and save the world. Raise dragons and participate in intense Dragon Wars with other guilds!\r\n\r\n > Dominate the World Arena in PvP\r\nRally your unbeatable team compositions by crafting flexible strategies and brawl with global players in fierce Arena battles. Immerse yourself in a splendid feast of wisdom and power while etching your name into the top global rankings by dominating your rivals!\r\n\r\n[Follow Us]\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/OmniheroesGame\r\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/kXwrq6kYud",
    "descriptionHTML": "Log in now and get 3 free 999 draws! \u2014 A gift from the Valkyries!<br><br>Omniheroes is a fantasy-themed idle strategy RPG. Dear Omniguardians, Palmarius awaits your salvation! Through the darkness, rescue the captive Valkyries from the demons and fight together against the evil threatening the world!<br><br> &gt; Assemble 100+ heroes<br>Rescue a host of captivating Valkyries and recruit them to your ranks. Each Valkyrie possesses unique skills and charm\u2014build your ultimate team! Log in now to enjoy hundreds of free draws and choose the legendary Valkyries you desire!<br><br> &gt; Engage deeply to reveal the many facets of your Valkyries<br>Valkyries reside in your Manor. Heal them and engage in delightful interactions to unlock various outfits! As a reward, the Valkyries will also help boost your power.<br><br> &gt; One-tap power surge<br>Easily develop your Valkyries, upgrade and enhance them to unlock hidden powers in Palmarius. Enjoy rich rewards even while idle, making your progress effortless.<br><br> &gt; A visual and auditory feast with top-quality effects<br>Behold 100+ enchanting and powerful heroes, designed and modeled by top-tier graphical artists, as they unleash spectacular skills in stylish 2D graphics.<br><br> &gt; Exciting seasonal updates<br>Each season brings new and thrilling content for you to explore, ensuring a fresh and exciting gaming experience. Season 5 is here! Engage in epic battles between gods and mortals, join forces with human and divine heroes to defeat the deities and save the world. Raise dragons and participate in intense Dragon Wars with other guilds!<br><br> &gt; Dominate the World Arena in PvP<br>Rally your unbeatable team compositions by crafting flexible strategies and brawl with global players in fierce Arena battles. Immerse yourself in a splendid feast of wisdom and power while etching your name into the top global rankings by dominating your rivals!<br><br>[Follow Us]<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/OmniheroesGame<br>Discord: https://discord.gg/kXwrq6kYud",
